{
  "version": 2,
  "engine": "wt",
  "name": "wt_talking_fold",
  "description": "Talking bass at 140: a wavefolder before a vowel filter; one looping curve moves the vowel and the fold together (fast vowel opening, a dip, a longer cry), a triplet stutter on the fold only at its peaks, a slow harmonic LFO on the formant; legato glides make it speak.",
